<title>INDIA: Indian 364-day t-bill yield unchanged at 12.65 pct.</title>
<headline>Indian 364-day t-bill yield unchanged at 12.65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it maintained a cut-off price of 88.80 rupees at the 364-day treasury bills auction on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was steady at 12.65 percent.  </p>
<p>The cut-off price has been unchanged for the past six auctions, they said.</p>
<p>RBI said it received 27 bids for a total amount of 8.79 billion rupees. It accepted 23 bids for 8.34 billion rupees.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
